Subject: [PATCH 426/572] fix(stm32mp2-fdts):fix LPDDR4 16bits swizzle

Fix swizzle distribution in LPDDR4 swizzle to set only necessary lines.
Adjust DBYTE number and DFI ports in STM32MP23 case.
Aligned with DDRCTRL_calc_v0.50.xlsx release.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git b085996fb2bf8e03270e4c9f266c9cfb5704eaac fix(stm32mp2-fdts):fix LPDDR4 16bits swizzle]
